{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"posts\":[{\"id\":17291,\"date\":\"2026-08-29T12:46:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-29T10:46:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"afterglow-screen-saver-after-dark-su-macos\",\"title\":\"Afterglow porta i classici screen saver “After Dark” su macOS\",\"excerpt\":\"È disponibile Afterglow, un’app che permette di eseguire i moduli originali di After Dark su macOS moderni, senza dipendenze da ROM o da classic Mac OS.\",\"categoryName\":\"Applicazioni\",\"categorySlug\":\"applicazioni\",\"categoryId\":13,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/Afterglow-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Afterglow\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17265,\"date\":\"2026-08-29T08:44:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-29T06:44:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"nuovi-mac-mini-mac-studio-con-macos-golden-gate\",\"title\":\"Nuovi Mac mini e Mac Studio in arrivo con macOS Golden Gate\",\"excerpt\":\"I nuovi Mac mini e Mac Studio annunciati da Apple sarebbero predisposti per arrivare con macOS Golden Gate, grazie a riferimenti alle funzioni di Siri AI nelle pagine prodotto e alle tempistiche di rilascio.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/macOS-27-next-to-MacBook-Pro-Running-macOS-27-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-27-next-to-MacBook-Pro-Running-macOS-27\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17240,\"date\":\"2026-08-28T12:02:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-28T10:02:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-spiega-perche-spotlight-indicizzazione-giorni-dopo-aggiornamento\",\"title\":\"Apple spiega perché l’indicizzazione di Spotlight può richiedere giorni dopo un aggiornamento\",\"excerpt\":\"Dopo un aggiornamento, Spotlight può impiegare giorni per completare l’indicizzazione. Apple chiarisce le ragioni del rallentamento e cosa aspettarsi durante la fase iniziale.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/iOS-27-Feature-Cool-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27-Feature-Cool\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17154,\"date\":\"2026-08-25T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-25T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rilascia-beta-7-macos-golden-gate-siri-ai-nuove-funzioni-ui\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia la beta 7 di macOS Golden Gate: Siri AI, nuove funzioni e ritocchi UI\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple mette a disposizione degli sviluppatori la settima beta di macOS Golden Gate. Tra le novità: Siri AI in stile chatbot, miglioramenti di interfaccia e strumenti AI in Foto, Safari, Password e Image Playground.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/macOS-27-next-to-MacBook-Pro-Running-macOS-27-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-27-next-to-MacBook-Pro-Running-macOS-27\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17162,\"date\":\"2026-08-24T22:35:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-24T20:35:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-seconda-release-candidate-macos-tahoe-26-7-sequoia-15-8\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia le seconde Release Candidate di macOS Tahoe 26.7 e macOS Sequoia 15.8\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple distribuisce agli sviluppatori le seconde Release Candidate di macOS Tahoe 26.7 e macOS Sequoia 15.8, a una settimana dalle prime. In parallelo arriva anche la beta 7 di macOS 27 Golden Gate.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/macos-tahoe-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macos-tahoe\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17059,\"date\":\"2026-08-21T09:28:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-21T07:28:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-26-7-roadmap-apple-iphone-ultra-airpods-fotocamere-robot-da-tavolo-nuovi-mac\",\"title\":\"macOS 26.7 svela la roadmap Apple: iPhone Ultra, AirPods con fotocamere, robot da tavolo e nuovi Mac\",\"excerpt\":\"macOS 26.7 mette in evidenza una roadmap ricca: iPhone Ultra, AirPods con fotocamere, un robot da tavolo, oltre a nuovi Mac e altre novità in arrivo.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/apple-roadmap-2026-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-roadmap-2026\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17055,\"date\":\"2026-08-21T08:44:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-21T06:44:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-26-7-rc-indizi-nuovi-prodotti-apple\",\"title\":\"macOS 26.7 RC svela indizi su oltre 10 nuovi prodotti Apple\",\"excerpt\":\"Nel codice di macOS 26.7 Release Candidate compaiono riferimenti a AirPods con fotocamera a infrarossi, iPhone pieghevole, un nuovo hub smart home, MacBook e iPad mini con OLED e un Siri Remote aggiornato per Apple TV.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/Apple-Event-Logo-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Event-Logo\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17013,\"date\":\"2026-08-19T12:46:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-19T10:46:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"airpods-con-fotocamere-video-nascosto-macos-tahoe-26-7\",\"title\":\"AirPods con fotocamere: il leak arriva da Apple con un video nascosto in macOS Tahoe 26.7\",\"excerpt\":\"Nella Release Candidate di macOS Tahoe 26.7 compare un breve video nascosto che mostra la Visual Intelligence in funzione su AirPods con fotocamere.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/airpods-con-fotocamera-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"airpods-con-fotocamera\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16981,\"date\":\"2026-08-19T08:22:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-19T06:22:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"disponibili-ios-27-macos-golden-gate-beta-6-e-non-solo-ecco-tutte-le-novita\",\"title\":\"Disponibili iOS 27 e macOS Golden Gate beta 6 (e non solo): ecco tutte le novità\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple rilascia le beta 6 di iOS 27 e macOS Golden Gate, insieme alle versioni beta 6 di iPadOS 27, watchOS 27 e tvOS 27.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/ios-27-three-iphones-fi.jpg-768x384.webp\",\"imageAlt\":\"ios-27-three-iphones-fi.jpg\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16989,\"date\":\"2026-08-18T08:44:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-18T06:44:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-tahoe-26-7-riferimenti-prodotti-apple-non-rilasciati\",\"title\":\"macOS Tahoe 26.7: riferimenti a prodotti Apple non ancora rilasciati\",\"excerpt\":\"macOS Tahoe 26.7 include riferimenti a prodotti Apple non ancora annunciati o rilasciati, suggerendo attività di sviluppo in corso e possibili aggiornamenti futuri.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/Apple-AI-Command-Center-Concept-Mock-1-Textless-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-AI-Command-Ce